# Shredder driver (tools/cov/specs/shredder.py), Torvus 01_swamp_entrance area 2: three lurking
# Shredders (A u04e6 e000200a8, B u04e3 e000200a7, C u04e2 e00020081) by the pool u0459.
# Create and an unsourced resisted-damage message (XRDG) reach C; Alert wakes A and B, which
# fly at the player side by side (separation). B takes a missile, then a normal shot whose
# projectile is the source of A's Damage message (XDMG with a weapon, exploding A). The player
# then stands in the pool, below C, which is alerted (start state 1 -> 3, the downward
# generate), attacks under water and takes a shot there (knockback in the fluid).
@f200 layer 3
@f300 god 1; objs Shredder; send u04e2 Create; send u04e2 0x58524447
@f310 send u04e6 Alert; send u04e3 Alert
@f420 obj u04e6; obj u04e3
@f540 shoot u04e3 missile
@f600 shoot u04e3; send u04e6 Damage from u0596
@f620 objs Shredder; obj u04e3
@f700 tp 154 -80 23
@f760 send u04e2 Alert
@f860 obj u04e2; objs Shredder
@f900 shoot u04e2
@f1000 obj u04e2; objs Shredder
